-- Achievement levels for the chat's tools (chat-director D003), on top of
-- mawta-api/tests/fixture.sql. Applied once, by the superuser, after it; only
-- the chat's tests load it.
--
-- The scenario, one case per rule of the glossary. I.E. Cristo Rey now has
-- four bimestres: I, II and III closed with levels, IV in progress (today, in
-- Lima) without any, as a real school mid-year.
--
--   5to B, Matemática (the consecutive-C streak):
--     Ana    MAT-C1  C, C, C      → streak 3
--     Bruno  MAT-C1  C, —, C      → a bimestre with no level breaks it: streak 1
--     Carla  MAT-C2  B, C, C      → streak 2
--     Diego  MAT-C1  C, C, B      → ends in B: no streak
--     Elena  MAT-C1  III: a C that was corrected to A (only the A is live),
--            and a C in a transversal competency: neither is a C for the tools
--   3ro A, five áreas, bimestre III (the promotion projection; 5to has another rule):
--     Fabiola  C in every competency of MAT, COM, ING and CYT → en riesgo de permanecer
--     Gabriel  only EPT (one competency) in C; CYT one C of two  → iría a recuperación
--     Hilda    all A                                            → promovería
--     Iván     left 3ro A on 2026-09-01; no levels
--   2do A, the same five áreas, bimestre III (2.° closes a cycle: the stricter rule):
--     Julia    no C, A or AD in half or more of MAT, COM and ING          → promovería
--     Kiara    all B: no C, but no área with half in A or AD             → iría a recuperación
--     Luis     all A but one C in CYT                                    → iría a recuperación
--     Marta    C in exactly half of MAT, COM, ING and CYT                → en riesgo de permanecer
--              (under the 1.°/3.°/4.° rule those áreas would pass: half is B or above)
--   5to B also closes a cycle; with only Matemática it has no área to promote with.
--
-- Ids: a0000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002xx, the trailing number says what the row is.

-- ------------------------------------------------------------------ periods --

update terms set status = 'closed', closed_at = '2026-08-01T00:00:00Z'
 where id = 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000032';

